  "description": "The Noah Disc Aero+ propels you forward with every pedal stroke. Thanks to its F-Steerer and F-Surface+ technology, this pure racer slices through wind like a warm knife through butter. With this bike you have the choice between an integrated handlebar/stem or aftermarket handlebar & stem. The first option is the most aero, but with the second you have more bike fitting options. Its lowered seat stays and leaf-spring-shaped top tube provide comfort, while its head tube, down tube and bottom bracket are responsible for its phenomenal power transfer. Every pedal stroke is flawlessly transformed into extra speed. The Noah Disc Aero+ is the perfect bike for anyone looking for an aerodynamic and reactive racer at a more affordable price.",
